OL,3,GNEWSAWelsh government mini-budget
OL,4,Apasses after Plaid-Labour deal
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Senedd has passed the Welsh
OL,7,Fgovernment's mini-budget, nearly four
OL,8,Fmonths after the original version was
OL,9,Fdefeated, following a deal between
OL,10,FPlaid Cymru ministers and Labour.
OL,12,FUnder the agreement, announced in
OL,13,FOctober, an extra #60m will be spent on
OL,14,Fsupporting children with additional
OL,15,Flearning needs (ALN).
OL,17,FLabour, now in opposition after heavy
OL,18,Felection losses, had rejected a #40m
OL,19,Fpackage spread over three years in
OL,20,FJuly, with leader Ken Skates demanding
OL,21,F#100m this financial year instead.
OL,23,APub: 03-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,438,430,260,140,0,100
