OL,3,GNEWSAWelsh government mini-budget
OL,4,Apasses after Plaid-Labour deal
OL,5,
OL,6,FBy voting for the extra spending plans
OL,7,Fon Tuesday evening Labour gave the
OL,8,Fminority Plaid government the numbers
OL,9,Fit needed.
